WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.693
Ben zipped out of the dressing room.

2
00:00:07.694 --> 00:00:11.351
It was opening night, and he couldn't wait to get onstage.

3
00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:17.913
His parents were back in town for the show, and of course, Uncle Bert and Sid were in the audience too.

4
00:00:17.914 --> 00:00:21.143
But right now he had to put his crown on.

5
00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:27.739
He found Winnie running around, checking props and costumes.

6
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:31.205
"Can you help me with my crown?" he asked.

7
00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:37.055
"Sure." While Winnie pinned Ben's crown in place, Mog came out of the dressing room.

8
00:00:37.056 --> 00:00:42.586
"Wow! You look like the real Mac—" Mog slapped his hand over his mouth.

9
00:00:42.587 --> 00:00:45.043
"Phew, that was close!"

10
00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.970
Jen's voice came over the loudspeaker.

11
00:00:47.971 --> 00:00:49.846
"Ten minutes to places.

12
00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:55.171
Ms. Lafang wants all cast and crew onstage now."

13
00:00:55.172 --> 00:01:01.947
As the cast gathered in a large circle, Winnie beamed. "Everyone looks amazing!"

14
00:01:01.948 --> 00:01:06.570
"Why, thank you!" Sonia spun around and fixed her hat.

15
00:01:06.571 --> 00:01:12.268
"You don't look too bad either, Ben," Lucy said as Victoria joined the circle.

16
00:01:12.269 --> 00:01:16.991
"I am so proud of you monsters," Victoria began.

17
00:01:16.992 --> 00:01:21.594
"You've worked hard, and it's been my honor to direct you.

18
00:01:21.595 --> 00:01:25.047
Now go out there and act your monstrous hearts out."

19
00:01:25.048 --> 00:01:28.493
She threw her arms up in the air. "Break a leg!"

20
00:01:28.494 --> 00:01:34.807
"What?" Mog cried. "I don't want to break a leg—or even a claw!" Victoria

21
00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:39.723
laughed. "I don't mean it literally, Mog. It's

22
00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:43.319
just how we theater people say good luck." Ben

23
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:48.342
slapped his forehead. "Not another superstition!" "This

24
00:01:48.343 --> 00:01:53.438
is more like a tradition or an expression," Victoria explained. "The

25
00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:56.217
side curtains are called the legs. You

26
00:01:56.218 --> 00:02:02.064
break them when you walk onstage. Now, on with the show!" "Three

27
00:02:02.065 --> 00:02:06.539
cheers for Victoria Lafang!" a fish monster cried. "Hooray!

28
00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:12.848
Hooray! Hooray!" the cast and crew shouted. "Places,

29
00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:17.099
everyone!" Jen announced over the loudspeaker. Monsters

30
00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:25.934
scattered as actors dashed to their places, and the backstage crew ran to run the lights, sound, and scenery. Ben

31
00:02:25.935 --> 00:02:29.112
stepped into the wings to wait for his cue. As

32
00:02:29.113 --> 00:02:34.809
the lights went down onstage, the audience grew hushed and quiet. Ben's

33
00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:39.587
heart was thumping loudly, and his palms were sweaty. "I'm

34
00:02:39.588 --> 00:02:44.939
so nervous," he thought as the curtain went up. "But

35
00:02:44.940 --> 00:03:04.574
there's no place I'd rather be." ***

36
00:03:04.575 --> 00:03:09.990
Onstage, Ben lay dying, Mog's sword sticking out of his chest.

37
00:03:09.991 --> 00:03:26.237
"'I will not yield!'" Ben gasped, and then fell back, dead.

38
00:03:26.238 --> 00:03:31.902
The audience broke into wild applause as the curtain dropped.

39
00:03:31.903 --> 00:03:37.260
Mog helped Ben up, patting him on the back as they lined up for their bows.

40
00:03:37.261 --> 00:03:41.159
"We did it!" Ben handed Mog's sword back to him.

41
00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.060
"And we were great." Mog grinned.

42
00:03:45.061 --> 00:03:49.567
"Ms. Lafang should put us in her next Hollyweird movie."

43
00:03:49.568 --> 00:03:55.615
The curtain opened, and the cast took their bows to thunderous clapping, hooting, and shouting.

44
00:03:55.616 --> 00:04:00.860
"Bravo! Bravo!" the audience called.

45
00:04:00.861 --> 00:04:07.802
After two more bows, Ben gestured for Ms. Lafang to join them onstage.

46
00:04:07.803 --> 00:04:12.311
Winnie presented her with an enormous bouquet of dead black roses.

47
00:04:12.312 --> 00:04:20.304
"How beautiful!" Ms. Lafang said, blowing kisses to the cast and audience. "Thank you, all!"

48
00:04:20.305 --> 00:04:25.719
And then at last, the curtain dropped.

49
00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:30.515
*** During the cast party, monsters and their families filled the

50
00:04:30.516 --> 00:04:34.255
cafeteria. Music played as monsters danced up a

51
00:04:34.256 --> 00:04:37.873
storm. Zombies stood near the snack table,

52
00:04:37.874 --> 00:04:43.480
drooling. Jen poured some punch. "What a great performance," she

53
00:04:43.481 --> 00:04:47.381
said. Ozzy sighed. "The play was

54
00:04:47.382 --> 00:04:49.994
great. But I still wish the curse had been

55
00:04:49.995 --> 00:04:55.086
real." Another ghoul patted him on the back. "Oh well. Maybe next

56
00:04:55.087 --> 00:05:00.995
time." Ben grinned at Winnie as the two of them danced

57
00:05:00.996 --> 00:05:03.682
together. "You should be proud, Ben," Winnie

58
00:05:03.683 --> 00:05:06.154
said. "The play was a monster

59
00:05:06.155 --> 00:05:08.841
hit!" "Yeah, it was amazing.

60
00:05:08.842 --> 00:05:12.725
I—" "Ben!" Sonia called as the three witches surrounded

61
00:05:12.726 --> 00:05:16.761
him. Ben groaned. "What did I do now?"

62
00:05:16.762 --> 00:05:22.942
"Nothing." Jade smiled. "We just wanted to say . . . congratulations!"

63
00:05:22.943 --> 00:05:25.707
"Turns out you're a pretty good actor."

64
00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:36.042
Lucy flipped her hair, and before Ben could reply, the witches danced away.

65
00:05:36.043 --> 00:05:40.404
Winnie and Ben started laughing when Uncle Bert danced over.

66
00:05:40.405 --> 00:05:46.379
"Ben, my boy, you made me proud!" Uncle Bert had a tear in one eye.

67
00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.264
"I knew you could do it!"

68
00:05:48.265 --> 00:05:50.432
"Thanks, Uncle Bert," Ben said.

69
00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:52.889
"You were right about the superstitions.

70
00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:55.613
They only become real when we believe in them.

71
00:05:55.614 --> 00:05:58.260
I'm really glad I didn't quit the play."

72
00:05:58.261 --> 00:06:02.294
"I'm glad too," Victoria said, joining them.

73
00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:06.621
"If you had, Bert and I wouldn't be having this reunion."

74
00:06:06.622 --> 00:06:08.623
"Reunion?" Ben said.

75
00:06:08.624 --> 00:06:12.450
Victoria nodded, confirming what Ben had suspected.

76
00:06:12.451 --> 00:06:16.627
"I haven't seen Bertie since our Monster Academy days.

77
00:06:16.628 --> 00:06:21.012
I used to have the biggest crush on your uncle."

78
00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:24.878
Uncle Bert blushed as Victoria hooked her arm through his.

79
00:06:24.879 --> 00:06:30.596
"Now," she said, "let's go discuss when you're going to visit me in Hollyweird."

80
00:06:30.597 --> 00:06:36.532
"Aw, they're in love," Winnie said as she watched the couple walk away.

81
00:06:36.533 --> 00:06:38.326
"What a happy ending!"

82
00:06:38.327 --> 00:06:54.709
Ben grinned. "As the title of another Quakespeare play says, 'All's well that ends well'!"

